From 53cd13d7017d1100ed45a4d76610ce72fe65335b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 02:18:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] PUBLISH-FIX-98: an ever-living funnel ordered by fitness, not
 a hot list
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Owner: 'There should absolutely not be a hot list. It should be an ever living funnel as things boil up
to fit what we are trying to do ... the one that fits the most is the first one to be there. Work
backwards if you need to.'

Working backwards from the bite: the size ladder sizes nothing unless the scenario target sits about
(roundTrip + stop) x REWARD_RISK_MIN above entry — ~5.5% on this account. The wall census showed that
is precisely where every qualified look died: 11,823 looks in four days, 71 passed every gate, 28 were
killed by the CAGE, 38 refused at sizing. The decisive one, ARB on 09-20 16:27, carried relative volume
23.587 and buying pressure 0.995 and was refused because its atrPct was 0.318% — a third of one percent
against a 1.6% round trip. It could not produce the target however violently it moved.

Raw range said which coin moved MOST. It never said which coin could CLEAR THE HURDLE.

- fitness = window range / hurdlePct (5.5), on every ranked row and carried on both nomination shapes.
- the ranked score is fitness discounted by liquidity and print density (unchanged: discounts, not vetoes).
- fresh nominees are planned FITTEST-FIRST, so the best coin takes the first free slot.
- a full lane: the WEAKEST eligible incumbent yields, and only to a nominee that fits better. A worse
  nominee is skipped FITS_LESS_THAN_EVERY_INCUMBENT and retried, because fit changes minute to minute.
- an adopted pair remembers the fit it entered with; an unscored incumbent (dropped by the watch) ranks
  below any scored one, so it is the first to go.
- with no scores anywhere the FIX-96 order stands (oldest first): nothing regresses.

Held/pending exposure is never evicted. The Judge's law is untouched; authority NONE throughout.

Tests: publish-fix-98-fitness-funnel 6/6, five of six fail on the previous code. Green:
learning-volatility-watch 4, publish-fix-94 7, publish-fix-96 5, tape-hot-lane 4, coin-dossier 3,
social-4f-scope 9, learning-mover-study 7.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RoFoPS22WFW1oUnbWzPayd
